  "name": "4thgrade_math_sirt",
  "description": "Data from a 4th grade math test of German students. Item response data in the Item Response Warehouse (IRW), a harmonised collection of item-level response data for psychometric research. 19,920 responses from 664 respondents to 30 items. Classified as: Child (<18y); Child (6-12y); Educational; Cognitive/educational; Test; Likert Scale/selected response; ger; Data from a 4th grade math test of German students..",
  "url": "https://itemresponsewarehouse.org/tables/4thgrade_math_sirt/",
  "version": "341.0.0",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-04",
  "license": "GPL-3.0",
  "citation": "Robitzsch A (2022). sirt: Supplementary Item Response Theory Models. R package version 3.12-66, https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=sirt.",
  "citeAs": "Robitzsch A (2022). sirt: Supplementary Item Response Theory Models. R package version 3.12-66, https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=sirt.",
